                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a039c735-55d1-4ccd-8973-52dc68284310",
                                "sense_id": "fd2f03c7-e22a-3476-ab22-d17a5b9f09e7",
                                "text": "OTIS. […] You should get out more, see people, mingle with different types. I’ll bet you haven’t mingled with my kind of man in a long time. MARIAN. A very long time. OTIS. It’ll be a new experience. Any new experience enriches you. MARIAN. Does that include drowning? OTIS. That’s witty, it really is. MARIAN. Some other time, Otis. Give me a ringie and maybe we’ll swingie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56af1b59-893c-4333-b0a4-727aa89d4000",
                                "sense_id": "fd2f03c7-e22a-3476-ab22-d17a5b9f09e7",
                                "text": "Let’s Workout^([sic]) At F.F.C. & Shed Those Inches Instantly! Pick Up That Phone And Give Me A Ringie, Linda!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f6266ca-b3c0-49b9-abf8-55be3bc926b0",
                                "sense_id": "fd2f03c7-e22a-3476-ab22-d17a5b9f09e7",
                                "text": "This is, maybe, not such a big deal as many non-geeks think: you still have to physically put a \"write ring\" into a slot in the back of the physical tape reel (\"No ringie, no writeie\" was the memory jogger) and/or turn a little dial on the newer tape cartridges."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d98855d1-b3c7-479f-8d1e-3a98108584c1",
                                "sense_id": "fd2f03c7-e22a-3476-ab22-d17a5b9f09e7",
                                "text": "Obviously, the Hobbits have lost the One Ring again! *sigh* \"Hey Dilbo, you're not invisible anymore...we can all SEE your hand... ...lookie, no ringie on your finger!\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cee1a9a2-e61a-42a2-9c99-bf26322a73b3",
                                "sense_id": "fd2f03c7-e22a-3476-ab22-d17a5b9f09e7",
                                "text": "Bye-bye, Steffie. If you ever need your A-list model again, you give me a ringie. I’d never turn down a chance to get naked with you."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
